  <h2>Read one complete learner progress note</h2>
  <div class="lead-rule"></div>
  <div class="thinking-card">
    <h3>Harbor learner note 18</h3>
    <p><span class="ex">My goal is to explain a project delay clearly. I’m enrolled in Business English 2, and I attend the Tuesday class. For three weeks, I have reviewed the model language and practiced one update after every lesson. In my first recording, I needed five written prompts. In today’s recording, I used two prompts and answered one follow-up question without help. The tutor’s feedback says my timeline is clear, but I need to give a more specific reason for the delay. Before the next class, I’m going to revise the reason and record the update again.</span></p>
  </div>
  <div class="quiz" data-quiz data-success-message="Correct. You recovered the goal, repeated study action, measurable evidence, and feedback-based next step from one learner note.">
    <h3>Reading check: use only learner note 18</h3>
    <div class="quiz-list">
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="explain a project delay clearly" data-hint="The first sentence states the ability the learner wants." data-fix="The learner’s goal is to explain a project delay clearly."><p class="quiz-question">1. What is the learner’s goal?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="explain a project delay clearly">explain a project delay clearly</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="teach the Business English course">teach the Business English course</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="pass a science examination">pass a science examination</button></div></div>
      <div class="quiz-item" data-quiz-item data-answer="reviewed model language and practiced one update" data-hint="The third sentence names the two actions repeated after every lesson." data-fix="The learner reviewed the model language and practiced one update after every lesson."><p class="quiz-question">2. What has the learner done for three weeks?</p><div class="quiz-options"><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="reviewed model language and practiced one update">reviewed model language and practiced one update</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="missed every class and deleted every recording">missed every class and deleted every recording</button><button class="quiz-option" data-quiz-option="taught the tutor and designed a new program">taught the tutor and designed a new program</button></div></div>
